# wear/man/gown_hang: the elven man's gown falling long and narrow from the gilt belt, flaring at the foot, the gilt line of
# its closing down the front, a gilt border over the hem; a little train behind in side views; it sways by whole rows,
# spreads over the striding legs and streams in the run
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2); fitted to the man (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
legend W metal2 0
body man
role garment gown
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10
# (z 10: over the shoe tips (legs/adult/loco/tips, z 9), so a foot lifted behind the hem stays under it)
sway 4
# (an elf stands a pixel taller in the legs: each view's stretch row doubles, so the hem still meets the shoes)

